              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“MUKAMA naagamba ati: Omu kasumi ako, amagufa ag'abakama ba Yuda, ag'abanyoro, aga banyakatagara, ag'abarangi n'ag'abasi aba Yerusaalemu, galiziikurwa omu bituuro byabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaalirwe omumaiso g'izooba, ag'okwezi, n'ag'ebintu byona eby'omumwanya ebi baagonzaaga kandi ebi baaherezaaga, ebi baahonderaga, ebi baaserraga kandi ebi baaramyaga; amagufa ago tigalisoroozibwa kandi tigaliziikwa; galiba nk'obusa obunagirwa ha rubungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ow'amahe naagamba ati: abaliba basigaireho ha ruganda oru orubi, omu biikaro byona ebi ndiba mbabingiiremu, balyegomba orufu okukira obwomeezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekibi n'Okucwerwa omusango",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
